    "The final sentence ('aligning with the highest level of the rubric's description of explicit and concrete actions') effectively communicates a numeric score of 5, violating the requirement not to directly state a numeric final score or gold label.",
    "The phrase 'highest level of the rubric's description' is a direct semantic pointer to the top rubric band, which constitutes a gold label leakage even though no number is used."
